ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  In a competitive auction, a jump raise is weak^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  When there is a transfer bid, the hand that made the transfer should count Bergen's Declarer Points^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  Delayed DONT^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Some play that a 1@D response denies a 4-card major which is not standard^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Opening a hand with four minors^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


